      "snippet": {
        "line": 366,
        "text": "physicalStressTheta (h) : PhysicalProfile := pullback h (-A h - 1 / 2) (theta P h), with CoordinateAlgebra.A h = 1/2 + h, so the weight is q ^ (-1 - h)"
